<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Dental cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Dental cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it downgraded United Dental Care Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- United Dental lost 8-1/8 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, United Dental said its second quarter results will be below analysts' estimates.</p>
</text>
